#: ../../source/controllers/corep4x.rst:27
msgid "Supported Display Fonts"
msgstr "支持的显示字体"

#: ../../source/controllers/corep4x.rst:29
msgid ""
"The CoreP4X firmware includes the following Montserrat fonts for LVGL and"
" M5UI: ``lv.font_montserrat_12``, ``lv.font_montserrat_14``, "
"``lv.font_montserrat_16``, ``lv.font_montserrat_18``, "
"``lv.font_montserrat_20``, ``lv.font_montserrat_22``, "
"``lv.font_montserrat_24``, ``lv.font_montserrat_30``, "
"``lv.font_montserrat_36``, ``lv.font_montserrat_40``, "
"``lv.font_montserrat_44``, ``lv.font_montserrat_48``."
msgstr ""
"CoreP4X 固件为 LVGL 和 M5UI 提供以下 Montserrat "
"字体：``lv.font_montserrat_12``、``lv.font_montserrat_14``、``lv.font_montserrat_16``、``lv.font_montserrat_18``、``lv.font_montserrat_20``、``lv.font_montserrat_22``、``lv.font_montserrat_24``、``lv.font_montserrat_30``、``lv.font_montserrat_36``、``lv.font_montserrat_40``、``lv.font_montserrat_44``、``lv.font_montserrat_48``。"

#: ../../source/controllers/corep4x.rst:31
msgid ""
"For ``M5.Lcd.FONTS``, the firmware also provides ``AlibabaPuHuiTiCN24``, "
"``AlibabaSansJA24``, and ``AlibabaSansKR24`` for Chinese, Japanese, and "
"Korean text respectively."
msgstr ""
"对于 ``M5.Lcd.FONTS``，固件还提供 ``AlibabaPuHuiTiCN24``、``AlibabaSansJA24`` 和 "
"``AlibabaSansKR24``，分别用于显示中文、日文和韩文。"

