#: ../../source/controllers/corep4x.rst:60
#: ../../source/controllers/corep4x.rst:151
msgid ""
"Display the date and a blue HH:MM:SS clock from the built-in RTC, using "
"UTC. Tap **SET TIME** to adjust hours, minutes, and seconds with the "
"**+** and **-** buttons. Tap **SAVE** to update the RTC while preserving "
"the date, or **CANCEL** to discard the changes."
msgstr ""
"读取内置 RTC，以 UTC 显示日期和蓝色 HH:MM:SS 时钟。点击 **SET TIME**，使用 **+**、**-** "
"调整时、分、秒。点击 **SAVE** 保存时间并保留原日期，或点击 **CANCEL** 放弃修改。"

