#: ../../source/controllers/corep4x.rst:90
#: ../../source/controllers/corep4x.rst:181
msgid ""
"Display USB VBUS and battery voltages in mV, charging status, Port A 5 V "
"output, and charge control. The battery voltage turns green while the "
"battery is charging. Tap **PORT A** to toggle external output and "
"**CHARGE** to enable or disable charging. Battery percentage is not "
"displayed."
msgstr ""
"显示 USB VBUS 和电池电压（mV）、充电状态、Port A 5 V 输出状态和充电许可。实际充电时，电池电压显示为绿色。点击 **PORT"
" A** 开关外部输出，点击 **CHARGE** 允许或禁止充电，不显示电量百分比。"

