#: ../../source/controllers/corep4x.rst:101
#: ../../source/controllers/corep4x.rst:194
msgid "Speaker Tone"
msgstr "扬声器音调"

#: ../../source/controllers/corep4x.rst:103
msgid "Open the |corep4x_speaker_tone_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |corep4x_speaker_tone_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/controllers/corep4x.rst:105
#: ../../source/controllers/corep4x.rst:196
msgid ""
"Use separate sliders to adjust frequency from 200 to 4000 Hz and volume "
"from 0 to 100%. The default values are 1000 Hz and 70%. Tap **Start "
"tone** or **Stop tone** to control playback. The PA switch controls the "
"amplifier independently; it is enabled at startup, while tone playback is"
" stopped. Turning PA off mutes the output without stopping the tone."
msgstr ""
"使用独立滑条调节频率（200～4000 Hz）和音量（0～100%），默认值为 1000 Hz 和 70%。点击 **Start tone** 或"
" **Stop tone** 控制音调播放。PA 开关独立控制功放；启动时 PA 默认开启，音调默认停止。关闭 PA 仅关闭声音输出，不停止音调。"

