#: ../../source/controllers/corep4x.rst:116
#: ../../source/controllers/corep4x.rst:209
msgid "Audio Recording and Playback"
msgstr "录音与播放"

#: ../../source/controllers/corep4x.rst:118
msgid "Open the |corep4x_audio_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |corep4x_audio_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/controllers/corep4x.rst:120
#: ../../source/controllers/corep4x.rst:211
msgid ""
"Record audio in memory at 8 kHz, mono, 16 bit. Tap **RECORD** to start "
"and **STOP REC** to finish, with a maximum duration of 30 seconds. Tap "
"**PLAY** to play the recording or **STOP PLAY** to stop playback. The "
"volume slider ranges from 0 to 100%, with a default of 70%. PA is enabled"
" automatically for playback."
msgstr ""
"以 8 kHz、单声道、16 bit 将音频录入内存。点击 **RECORD** 开始录音，点击 **STOP REC** 结束，最长录制 30 "
"秒。点击 **PLAY** 回放录音，点击 **STOP PLAY** 停止播放。音量滑条范围为 0～100%，默认 70%；播放时自动开启 "
"PA。"

