msgid "Infrared Transmission and Reception"
msgstr "红外发送与接收"

#: ../../source/controllers/corep4x.rst:133
msgid "Open the |corep4x_ir_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |corep4x_ir_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/controllers/corep4x.rst:135
#: ../../source/controllers/corep4x.rst:226
msgid ""
"Use the built-in infrared receiver on G13 and transmitter on G49. Tap the"
" send button to transmit an NEC frame with address 0x08 and an "
"incrementing data byte. The screen shows transmitted data, received "
"address and data, and the receive count. Use an NEC-compatible infrared "
"remote control to test reception."
msgstr ""
"使用 G13 的板载红外接收器和 G49 的发射器。点击发送按钮，发送地址为 0x08、数据字节逐次递增的 NEC "
"帧。界面显示发送数据、接收地址与数据以及接收次数。可使用支持 NEC 协议的红外遥控器测试接收。"

